@startuml 06-age-assurance-and-guardian-consent-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans SC"
skinparam shadowing false
title 年龄核验与十五分钟监护邀请

participant "用户" as minor
participant "客户端" as client
participant "identity.Service" as api
participant "年龄核验网关" as gateway
participant "监护人" as guardian
participant "mobile聚合事务" as db
client -> api : 读取年龄核验配置并显式创建会话
api -> gateway : 按配置发起签名请求
gateway -> api : 查询或验证结果，未知保持关闭
api -> db : 更新资格与状态
minor -> api : 创建15分钟一次性监护邀请
guardian -> api : 领取邀请并提交用途级确认
api -> db : 核对当前双方资格、有效期和scope后保存
client -> api : 重新读取服务端eligibility

@enduml
